MeanVC2-ONNX
ONNX exports of MeanVC2 for streaming inference, by kiarina.

This repository contains converted weights. The conversion changes the
format (and, for the *.int8.onnx files, quantizes MatMul/Gemm weights to
int8); it does not retrain anything. Each part keeps the license of the work
it was converted from.

