    (weights from https://huggingface.co/s3prl/converted_ckpts,
    revision 8cad0b370e7e35f8d56951d95d2be036ea85510c)
  - WavLM model code from s3prl, Apache License 2.0,
    https://github.com/s3prl/s3prl (commit ec8064b5889f81ca460fbe2c094ce576a6f120b7)
